# A9: one body, three registrations writing its language header above body:, without a space, and in upper case.
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/drinks#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

ex:drinks a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Drinks"@en , "Dranken"@nl ; skos:hasTopConcept ex:tea .
ex:tea a skos:Concept ; skos:topConceptOf ex:drinks ; skos:prefLabel "Tea"@en , "Thee"@nl .
